{"id":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","revision":0,"last_node_id":14,"last_link_id":13,"nodes":[{"id":1,"type":"CheckpointLoaderSimple","pos":[40,340],"size":[270,127.59375],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"ckpt_name","name":"ckpt_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"ckpt_name"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"MODEL","name":"MODEL","type":"MODEL","links":[1,2]},{"localized_name":"CLIP","name":"CLIP","type":"CLIP","links":[3]},{"localized_name":"VAE","name":"VAE","type":"VAE","links":[12]}],"title":"Load Flux checkpoint","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.27.0","Node name for S&R":"CheckpointLoaderSimple"},"widgets_values":["flux1-dev-fp8.safetensors"]},{"id":2,"type":"CLIPTextEncode","pos":[420,160],"size":[400,200],"flags":{},"order":8,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"clip","name":"clip","type":"CLIP","link":3},{"localized_name":"text","name":"text","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"text"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"CONDITIONING","name":"CONDITIONING","type":"CONDITIONING","links":[4]}],"title":"Positive prompt","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.27.0","Node name for S&R":"CLIPTextEncode"},"widgets_values":["Documentary photograph of a spacecraft in orbit around a gas giant, 85mm lens, shallow depth of field. Mid shot, the craft filling two thirds of the frame: a cylindrical pressure module in scuffed white thermal paint with handrails, panel seams and small fittings, wrapped at one end in creased amber kapton foil with visible tape seams, and a flat white radiator panel extending edge on. Boxy and unstreamlined, no windows, no wings, no visible engines. The sun is off frame to the left and out of shot. Its light rakes across the hull leaving a razor sharp terminator line, and the shadowed side of the hull is solid black. Behind and below, softly out of focus, the amber cloud bands of a gas giant fill the lower left. Sparse pinpoint stars on true black. Fine film grain."]},{"id":3,"type":"FluxGuidance","pos":[900,160],"size":[270,311.59375],"flags":{},"order":9,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"conditioning","name":"conditioning","type":"CONDITIONING","link":4},{"localized_name":"guidance","name":"guidance","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"guidance"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"CONDITIONING","name":"CONDITIONING","type":"CONDITIONING","links":[5]}],"title":"Flux guidance","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.27.0","Node name for S&R":"FluxGuidance"},"widgets_values":[3.5]},{"id":4,"type":"EmptySD3LatentImage","pos":[420,560],"size":[270,143.59375],"flags":{},"order":1,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"width","name":"width","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"width"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"height","name":"height","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"height"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"batch_size","name":"batch_size","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"batch_size"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"LATENT","name":"LATENT","type":"LATENT","links":[10]}],"title":"Empty latent 1280x704","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.27.0","Node name for S&R":"EmptySD3LatentImage"},"widgets_values":[1280,704,1]},{"id":5,"type":"BasicScheduler","pos":[900,580],"size":[270,143.59375],"flags":{},"order":7,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"model","name":"model","type":"MODEL","link":2},{"localized_name":"scheduler","name":"scheduler","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"scheduler"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"steps","name":"steps","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"steps"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"denoise","name":"denoise","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"denoise"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"SIGMAS","name":"SIGMAS","type":"SIGMAS","links":[9]}],"title":"Sigma schedule","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.27.0","Node name for S&R":"BasicScheduler"},"widgets_values":["simple",24,1]},{"id":6,"type":"KSamplerSelect","pos":[900,780],"size":[270,79.59375],"flags":{},"order":2,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"sampler_name","name":"sampler_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"sampler_name"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"SAMPLER","name":"SAMPLER","type":"SAMPLER","links":[8]}],"title":"Select sampler: euler","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.27.0","Node name for S&R":"KSamplerSelect"},"widgets_values":["euler"]},{"id":7,"type":"BasicGuider","pos":[1220,300],"size":[225,71.59375],"flags":{},"order":10,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"model","name":"model","type":"MODEL","link":1},{"localized_name":"conditioning","name":"conditioning","type":"CONDITIONING","link":5}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"GUIDER","name":"GUIDER","type":"GUIDER","links":[7]}],"title":"Guider: positive only","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.27.0","Node name for S&R":"BasicGuider"},"widgets_values":[]},{"id":8,"type":"RandomNoise","pos":[900,420],"size":[270,82],"flags":{},"order":3,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"noise_seed","name":"noise_seed","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"noise_seed"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"NOISE","name":"NOISE","type":"NOISE","links":[6]}],"title":"Noise seed","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.27.0","Node name for S&R":"RandomNoise"},"widgets_values":[930001,"fixed"]},{"id":9,"type":"SamplerCustomAdvanced","pos":[1520,380],"size":[225,143.59375],"flags":{},"order":11,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"noise","name":"noise","type":"NOISE","link":6},{"localized_name":"guider","name":"guider","type":"GUIDER","link":7},{"localized_name":"sampler","name":"sampler","type":"SAMPLER","link":8},{"localized_name":"sigmas","name":"sigmas","type":"SIGMAS","link":9},{"localized_name":"latent_image","name":"latent_image","type":"LATENT","link":10}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"output","name":"output","type":"LATENT","links":[11]},{"localized_name":"denoised_output","name":"denoised_output","type":"LATENT","links":null}],"title":"Sampler","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.27.0","Node name for S&R":"SamplerCustomAdvanced"},"widgets_values":[]},{"id":10,"type":"VAEDecode","pos":[1860,380],"size":[225,71.59375],"flags":{},"order":12,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"samples","name":"samples","type":"LATENT","link":11},{"localized_name":"vae","name":"vae","type":"VAE","link":12}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"IMAGE","name":"IMAGE","type":"IMAGE","links":[13]}],"title":"Decode to image","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.27.0","Node name for S&R":"VAEDecode"},"widgets_values":[]},{"id":11,"type":"SaveImage","pos":[2060,380],"size":[270,315.578125],"flags":{},"order":13,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"images","name":"images","type":"IMAGE","link":13},{"localized_name":"filename_prefix","name":"filename_prefix","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"filename_prefix"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"images","name":"images","type":"IMAGE","links":null}],"title":"Save image","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.27.0"},"widgets_values":["stills/shot"]},{"id":12,"type":"Note","pos":[420,780],"size":[430,250],"flags":{},"order":4,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"There is no negative prompt","properties":{},"widgets_values":["Flux is guidance-distilled, so it has no unconditional pass and no negative\nconditioning exists. That is why this graph uses BasicGuider, which takes one model\nand one conditioning, rather than CFGGuider or KSampler.\n\nStrength is set by FluxGuidance on the conditioning instead. 3.0 to 3.5 for\nphotoreal; higher gets glossier, not more controlled.\n\nFlux 1 also needs EmptySD3LatentImage, not EmptyLatentImage: its latents are\n16 channel. And BasicScheduler with 'simple'."],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":13,"type":"Note","pos":[900,980],"size":[440,300],"flags":{},"order":5,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Structural negations work, optical ones do not","properties":{},"widgets_values":["The hard-won part of this prompt. Measured on this exact graph:\n\n  \"no windshield, no wings, no windows\"  -> obeyed\n  \"boxy and unstreamlined\"               -> obeyed\n  \"no lens flare, no bloom, no glow\"     -> IGNORED\n  \"no fill light at all\"                 -> IGNORED\n\nSo do not tell it what the image should not look like. Remove the cause instead:\n  \"the sun is off frame to the left and out of shot\"   kills the bloom\n  \"the shadowed side of the hull is solid black\"       kills the fill\n\nAnd it is seed-dependent: the off-frame sun landed on 1 of 3 seeds. Run several,\nkeep the one where the constraint held. See docs/prompting-flux-for-realism.md."],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":14,"type":"Note","pos":[1520,780],"size":[440,280],"flags":{},"order":6,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Why the framing is a mid shot","properties":{},"widgets_values":["Genre nouns pull toward concept art. \"Deep-space vessel\" produced a streamlined\nwhite space yacht with a windshield. \"Pressure module\", \"truss\", \"radiator panel\",\n\"documentary photograph\" produced hardware.\n\nFraming matters as much as wording. A tight detail shot was the most photographic\nof everything tried, because a close shot gives the illustration prior almost\nnothing to grab. A full-ship wide was the worst. Two thirds of frame is the usable\nmiddle: enough scene to be a scene, tight enough that the prior stays out.\n\nFlux writes gibberish on any surface that looks like it wants lettering. Keep such\nsurfaces out of frame or plan to paint it out."],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"}],"links":[[1,1,0,7,0,"MODEL"],[2,1,0,5,0,"MODEL"],[3,1,1,2,0,"CLIP"],[4,2,0,3,0,"CONDITIONING"],[5,3,0,7,1,"CONDITIONING"],[6,8,0,9,0,"NOISE"],[7,7,0,9,1,"GUIDER"],[8,6,0,9,2,"SAMPLER"],[9,5,0,9,3,"SIGMAS"],[10,4,0,9,4,"LATENT"],[11,9,0,10,0,"LATENT"],[12,1,2,10,1,"VAE"],[13,10,0,11,0,"IMAGE"]],"groups":[],"config":{},"extra":{"ds":{"scale":0.7160946745562143,"offset":[-685.6088762105106,419.1072181367992]}},"version":0.4}